{"id": "DfAVIGIxwiN", "title": "Video by vedic_twist", "description": "Mahabharata ki ye kahani bahut kam log jaante hain. Asli twist Part 2 mein hai, follow karo.\n\nAdi Parva, adhyay 76. Devtaon ke guru Brihaspati ne apne bete Kacha ko asuron ke guru Shukracharya ke paas bheja, Sanjivani vidya seekhne.\n\nAsuron ne Kacha ko teen baar maara. Teesri baar uski raakh Shukracharya ki madira mein mila di. Aur Kacha ne guru ke pet ke andar se hi Sanjivani seekhi.\n\nBahar aakar usne apne guru ko wapas jeevit kiya. Isi ghatna ke baad Shukracharya ne brahmanon ke liye madira ko mahapaap ghoshit kiya.\n\nAnkahi Kahaniyan, Part 1. Part 2: Devayani ka shraap.\n\n#mahabharata #indianmythology #ankahikahaniyan", "channel": "vedic_twist", "uploader_id": "30248523911", "uploader": "Vedic twist | Mahabharata facts", "timestamp": 1793120007, "like_count": 105076, "comment_count": 266, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1106724832328168a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.096, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMWDPW4candRyohGs-VF06jXXkeDwAgbxVvHeqPTqhx8c3Xg8iG4uq99WSL7hBMaP4V787t1kT5gT1j7NF69DBFll4GOAI_BdJbbO8.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=t7J1Np5HXtIQ7kNvwHW0hM4&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=qr3bIMiW0PTkU1m1C3taxQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTTUseFvzTItnX1n0UywbjUbADSg8zgsy784gOha4NoVg&oe=6AF3E305", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 66.096, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "R